{"id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pda-transition-semantics.md","title":"Pushdown-Automaton Transition","display":"df-pushdown-transition — Pushdown-Automaton Transition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","aliases":["73-df-pda-transition-semantics","73-df-pushdown-transition"],"display":"df-pushdown-transition — Pushdown-Automaton Transition","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-configuration-space]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pda-transition-semantics</span><span>73-df-pushdown-transition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pushdown-transition — Pushdown-Automaton Transition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6aea2e756d32c1b\" href=\"?note=f6aea2e756d32c1b\" title=\"73-df-pda-configuration-space\">73-df-pda-configuration-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (pushdown automaton)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span> (configuration set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f6aea2e756d32c1b\" href=\"?note=f6aea2e756d32c1b\" title=\"73-df-pda-configuration-space\">73-df-pda-configuration-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}\\)</span> (reflexive transitive closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>；所有栈分解见证都在一步关系的右侧存在量化，不将同一配置对的不同表示当作不同调用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>；其参数仍是原转移函数的字符或空标签，不改变转移标签的类型。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_MC&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\exists X\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n(C=(q,\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}(a)y,X\\beta)\\land C&#39;=(p,y,\\gamma\\beta)\\land(p,\\gamma)\\in\\delta(q,a,X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_MC&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\exists X\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n(C=(q,\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}(a)y,X\\beta)\\land C&#39;=(p,y,\\gamma\\beta)\\land(p,\\gamma)\\in\\delta(q,a,X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nD_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^2:C\\vdash_MC&#39;\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nD_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^2:C\\vdash_MC&#39;\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M^*C&#39;\\leftrightarrow(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}(D_M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M^*C&#39;\\leftrightarrow(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}(D_M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一步关系通过存在量化选择输入分解与栈分解。WordLabel 将空标签映为 ε，将输入字符映为单字符词；其余栈后缀 β 保持不变。没有栈顶字符时不存在一步后继。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-configuration-space","status":"resolved","id":"f6aea2e756d32c1b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-configuration-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-configuration-space","status":"resolved","id":"f6aea2e756d32c1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$ (configuration set, see [[73-df-pda-configuration-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*$ 见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]；其参数仍是原转移函数的字符或空标签，不改变转移标签的类型。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}","display":false},{"tex":"C,C'\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_MC'\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\exists X\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n(C=(q,\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}(a)y,X\\beta)\\land C'=(p,y,\\gamma\\beta)\\land(p,\\gamma)\\in\\delta(q,a,X))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nD_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C')\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^2:C\\vdash_MC'\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M^*C'\\leftrightarrow(C,C')\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}(D_M)","display":true}],"bytes":1964,"backlinks":[{"id":"5bc7edf5698ebdc7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\vdash_M^*$ (zero-or-more transition relation, see [[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]])"},{"id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\vdash_M^*$ (zero-or-more transition relation, see [[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]])"}],"outgoing":["f6aea2e756d32c1b","25902d0bd75ea963","0a6da8c909717780"]}